A MOVE X (1:L) TO T (I)
  SELECTED EC-BOUND-REF-MOD
B MOVE T (I) TO X (1:L)
  SELECTED EC-BOUND-SUBSCRIPT
C MOVE N (I) TO O (1)
  SELECTED EC-BOUND-SUBSCRIPT
D MOVE O (1) TO N (I)
  SELECTED EC-BOUND-ODO
E MOVE X (1:L) TO T (I) (1:2)
  SELECTED EC-BOUND-REF-MOD
F MOVE X (1:L) TO T (FUNCTION SQRT (NEG))
  SELECTED EC-BOUND-REF-MOD
G MOVE FUNCTION SQRT (NEG) TO N (I)
  SELECTED EC-ARGUMENT-FUNCTION
I MOVE X (1:L) TO BX
  SELECTED EC-BOUND-REF-MOD
J MOVE BX TO X (1:L)
  SELECTED EC-DATA-PTR-NULL
H EVALUATE V WHEN Z THRU A WHEN T (I)
  SELECTED EC-RANGE-INVALID
  SELECTED EC-BOUND-SUBSCRIPT
CONTROL T (2) = ABCD N (2) = 0003 O (1) = 0003
